&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;（構成員）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;福尾 博永（議長）、菊地 和博、髙橋 経一、&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;斎藤 千草、髙橋 渡&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
